Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: fellowship-installer
Architecture: any
Depends: cage, cog, lvm2, gdisk, parted, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, squashfs-tools,
 grub-efi-amd64, grub-efi-amd64-signed, shim-signed, efibootmgr, adduser,
 ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: FellowshipOS NAS installer
 The graphical installer the boot menu's NAS entry starts. It runs in the
 live system, shows its page full screen on the machine's own monitor, and
 serves it to other computers after pairing. It never reaches an installed
 system.
